info:Boat that rows across the top of the water.
info_origin:2
info_how_created:~
Designed the structure and neural net. Evolved only the weights and properties of the neurons. Was unsure if Ff modifiers applied to water.~
info_performance:~
Rows like a kayaker across the surface of the water. Seems to be the top speed for this particular design. I plan on creating more 'boat' frams.
This creature was awarded.~
