info_author:Pawel Kedziora
info_author_ispublic:1
info_email:
info_email_ispublic:0
info:
info_origin:1
info_how_created:The creature was created manually.
info_performance:~
I was going to create a creature which moves using legs. Each leg tries to grab water when it is open. After that, it folds up and conducts backward movement. It consists of 4 legs. 
It looks interesting but is not fast. After optimization, it was very fast but the movement was no longer symmetrical.~
