info_email_ispublic:0
info:Water surface food finder.
info_origin:1
info_how_created:~
I wanted to create a swimmer that could find food on the surface, but was more hydrodynamic than was allowable with multiple sensors.~
info_performance:~
It swims on the water's surface in a wave pattern, and uses the motion of its one smell sensor to detect and orient toward food.~
